Wakefield Council is seeking a service provider to delivery a health Checks Service.  
KEY SERVICE OUTCOMES The Provider must deliver the following outcomes to improve access to the NHS Health Checks programme for Wakefield District: 

* Identification of the eligible population and % Target Population, and offer an NHS Health Check; 
* Completion of an NHS Health Check for those who accept the offer; 
* High quality and timely lifestyle advice to all who receive an NHS Health Check; and

